{"id":"6d4131ca1202619d","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-compactness.md","title":"内部有限前提紧致性","display":"thm-compactness — 内部有限前提紧致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-compactness","aliases":["29-thm-compactness"],"display":"thm-compactness — 内部有限前提紧致性","depends_on":["[[29-thm-completeness]]","[[29-df-satisfiable]]","[[29-df-logical-consequence]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness — 内部有限前提紧致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f92cb4acad3757e\" href=\"?note=7f92cb4acad3757e\" title=\"29-thm-completeness\">29-thm-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ea5b4fccf12f679\" href=\"?note=5ea5b4fccf12f679\" title=\"29-df-satisfiable\">29-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"deaf0e86bfe2a066\" href=\"?note=deaf0e86bfe2a066\" title=\"29-df-logical-consequence\">29-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a> 的假式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\tau\">\\(\\models_\\tau\\)</span> 分别取任意非空结构上的可满足性和后承，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ea5b4fccf12f679\" href=\"?note=5ea5b4fccf12f679\" title=\"29-df-satisfiable\">29-df-satisfiable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"deaf0e86bfe2a066\" href=\"?note=deaf0e86bfe2a066\" title=\"29-df-logical-consequence\">29-df-logical-consequence</a>；不取有限模型专用版本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma:|\\Delta|&lt;\\infty\\}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma:|\\Delta|&lt;\\infty\\}\\)</span> 是有限子集族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\bot\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Delta\\models_\\tau\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\bot\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Delta\\models_\\tau\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau(\\Gamma)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条替代原第57本书的悬空紧致性目标。由内部强完备性的有限前提证书取得第一式，再由假式的语义得到第二式。这里不能把 Struct 换成 STRUC；原有限非紧致性示例仍保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-thm-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$；$\\bot$ 为 [[29-df-atomic-formula]] 的假式。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau$ 与 $\\models_\\tau$ 分别取任意非空结构上的可满足性和后承，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]、[[29-df-logical-consequence]]；不取有限模型专用版本。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau$ 与 $\\models_\\tau$ 分别取任意非空结构上的可满足性和后承，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]